<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Quick Build: error state. The bolt, shrunk to make room for an exclamation mark - so the "this failed" cue is a badge
	rather than the red tint, and survives color perception (see QuickBuildTone). Replaces the old slashed bolt, which read as
	"Quick Build is switched off" rather than "a build failed". -->
